---
---

<section id="smartscreen" class="py-16 bg-dark-bg">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
		<div class="rounded-2xl border border-dark-border bg-gradient-to-b from-dark-card to-dark-bg p-8 md:p-12 relative overflow-hidden">
			<!-- Subtle corner accent -->
			<div class="absolute -right-20 -top-20 h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-minotaur/10 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

			<div class="max-w-2xl">
				<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md bg-blue-500/10 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-400 border border-blue-500/20">
					Windows Defender Notice
				</span>
				<h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
					Running Minotaur on Windows for the first time
				</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
					Because Minotaur Launcher is an open-source community release without an enterprise commercial code-signing certificate, Windows Defender SmartScreen may show an alert:
					<em class="text-white not-italic font-medium">"Windows protected your PC: Microsoft Defender SmartScreen prevented an unrecognized app from starting."</em>
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
				<div class="rounded-xl border border-dark-border/80 bg-dark-bg/60 p-5 flex items-start gap-4">
					<div class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-minotaur/20 text-minotaur font-bold text-sm">
						1
					</div>
					<div>
						<h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Click "More info"</h3>
						<p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-400">
							On the blue Windows SmartScreen popup, click the underlined text link that says "More info".
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="rounded-xl border border-dark-border/80 bg-dark-bg/60 p-5 flex items-start gap-4">
					<div class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-minotaur/20 text-minotaur font-bold text-sm">
						2
					</div>
					<div>
						<h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Click "Run anyway"</h3>
						<p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-400">
							A "Run anyway" button will appear at the bottom right. Click it to launch Minotaur.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<p class="mt-6 text-xs text-slate-500">
				Minotaur Launcher is 100% open source. You can inspect all source code directly on our GitHub repository.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
